  "body": "I maintain https://github.com/wheresrhys/fetch-mock (a mock fetch implementation) and it's been brought to my attention that I don't support the `redirected` property on Responses. \r\n\r\nReading the spec, the `redirected` property is a getter dependent on the private implementation of `url list`. Is there any way I can create a synthetic redirected Response?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
